1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
 You don't need discipline to lose weight.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,100
 Let me explain.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,440
 When I first started my fitness journey,

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,960
 I thought I need to be disciplined as fuck

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,640
 to actually see results.

6
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:09,660
 And when you think of discipline,

7
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,640
 it kind of gives military vibes.

8
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:12,320
 You know what I mean?

9
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,720
 It's giving restriction.

10
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:16,000
 And the more you come from that place,

11
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,940
 the more you're gonna want to rebel or stay off the course.

12
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,120
 This ultimately leads you to self-sabotaging.

13
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,100
 So I stopped thinking about how to stay disciplined

14
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,140
 in my fitness journey and instead start focusing

15
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:30,480
 on how I can be devoted to my fitness goals.

16
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,060
 Now, devotion gives self-love.

17
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,760
 It's giving honoring yourself.

18
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,200
 And that's how I want you to approach your fitness journey.

19
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,300
 You're not disciplined to show up to the gym.

20
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,980
 You're devoted to moving your body

21
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,880
 because you know it's gonna help you long-term.

22
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,740
 You're not disciplined to stick to your diet.

23
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:48,320
 You're devoted to fueling your body better

24
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,640
 that's gonna make you feel good,

25
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,780
 not just in the moment, but also after the fact.

26
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,060
 By changing the way you speak about your goals,

27
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:55,640
 you start to position yourself

28
00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:58,220
 as a person who's choosing to show up

29
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,860
 rather than someone who's forced to check off a box.

30
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,260
 It's all in here, bitch.

31
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:04,640
 Not discipline, think devotion.

